.\" -*- mode: nroff -*-
.TH OPENOMEN 1 "2026-07-03" "openomen 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
openomen \- CLI tool for HP Victus/OMEN laptop management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openomen
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B openomen
is an unofficial CLI, driver and daemon for managing HP Victus/OMEN laptops
on Linux. It provides fan control, power profile management, and real-time
system monitoring.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B fan
Control fan behavior.
.RS
.TP
.B max
Set fans to maximum RPM.
.TP
.B auto
Restore BIOS/auto fan control.
.TP
.B toggle
Toggle fan max on/off.
.TP
.B status
Show current fan status.
.RE
.TP
.B cpu
Read current CPU stats.
.TP
.B gpu
Read current GPU stats.
.TP
.B stats
Show unified system stats dashboard.
.RS
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-watch
Update every 2 seconds (exit with Ctrl+C).
.RE
.TP
.B info
Show system information for debugging.
.TP
.B power
Manage power profiles.
.RS
.TP
.B status
Show current power profile.
.TP
.B set
Set ACPI power profile directly.
.TP
.B apply
Apply a combined profile (gaming, balanced, quiet).
.TP
.B list
List available profiles.
.RE
.TP
.B doctor
Check hardware compatibility and driver status.
.TP
.B update
Update OpenOMEN to the latest version.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Max fan speed:
.RS 4
.B openomen fan max
.RE
.PP
Real-time dashboard:
.RS 4
.B openomen stats \-w
.RE
.PP
List power profiles:
.RS 4
.B openomen power list
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lm_sensors (1)
.SH AUTHORS
OpenOMEN project.
.PP
.UR https://github.com/openomen/openomen
.UE
